msgid "End-to-End Process Flow"
msgstr "全体の処理フロー"

msgid "This guide walks through the entire TMM (Technical Intern & Specified Skilled Worker) journey — from setting up stakeholders and apprentice orders, through candidate recruitment & selection at the LPK, training, documentation & departure to Japan, and finally the return home. Each step shows the responsible role, the menu path, and how the data connects."
msgstr "本ガイドは、TMM（技能実習・特定技能）の全行程を順に説明します — 関係機関と実習生オーダーの設定、LPKでの候補者募集・選考、研修、書類手続きと日本への出発、そして帰国まで。各ステップに担当する役割、メニューの場所、データのつながりを示しています。"

msgid "Set Up Stakeholders"
msgstr "関係機関の登録"

msgid "Register every partner organisation before any order"
msgstr "オーダーの前にすべての提携組織を登録します"

msgid "LPK — Vocational Training Institution"
msgstr "LPK — 職業訓練機関"

msgid "Register each LPK partner, then create its login user and verify the email so the LPK can operate independently."
msgstr "提携するLPKを登録し、ログインユーザーを作成してメールを確認すると、LPKが単独で操作できるようになります。"

msgid "Create institution record (name, address, contacts)"
msgstr "機関情報を作成（名称・住所・連絡先）"

msgid "Create LPK user account & assign role"
msgstr "LPKユーザーアカウントを作成し役割を割り当て"

msgid "Email verification → LPK activates & sets password"
msgstr "メール確認 → LPKが有効化しパスワードを設定"

msgid "AO — Acceptance Organization"
msgstr "AO — 受入機関"

msgid "The company in Japan that will accept the interns. Record its profile and job needs."
msgstr "実習生を受け入れる日本の企業です。企業情報と求人内容を登録します。"

msgid "Kumiai — Cooperative Association"
msgstr "組合 — 協同組合"

msgid "The supervising cooperative that mediates between the AO and the sending side."
msgstr "受入機関と送出し側の間を仲介する監理団体です。"

msgid "For the Specified Skilled Worker (SSW) route — the registered support organisation."
msgstr "特定技能（SSW）ルートの場合 — 登録支援機関です。"

msgid "Create Apprentice Order & Share to LPK"
msgstr "実習生オーダーを作成しLPKへ配分"

msgid "Create Apprentice Order"
msgstr "実習生オーダーを作成"

msgid "Define how many interns are needed (male/female), the job category, and link the Kumiai + Acceptance Organization."
msgstr "必要な実習生の人数（男女別）と職種を決め、組合と受入機関を紐づけます。"

msgid "Share Order to LPK"
msgstr "オーダーをLPKへ配分"

msgid "Distribute the order to one or more LPK so they can start recruiting candidates against it."
msgstr "オーダーを一つ以上のLPKへ配分し、候補者の募集を開始できるようにします。"

msgid "Recruitment & Selection Pipeline"
msgstr "募集・選考の流れ"

msgid "LPK only sees its own candidates"
msgstr "LPKは自機関の候補者のみ閲覧できます"

msgid "Collect Candidates"
msgstr "候補者の登録"

msgid "Enter each applicant with personal data, family, education & experience, then upload their documents."
msgstr "応募者ごとに個人情報・家族・学歴・職歴を入力し、書類をアップロードします。"

msgid "Selection stages (each recorded per candidate, then combined into an integrated score):"
msgstr "選考の各段階（候補者ごとに記録し、総合評価にまとめます）："

msgid "Medical Check-Up"
msgstr "健康診断"

msgid "Integrated Scoring"
msgstr "総合評価"

msgid "Promote → Trainee"
msgstr "昇格 → 研修生"

msgid "Integrated Scoring combines placement test + interview + MCU into a readiness view."
msgstr "総合評価は、配置試験・面接・健康診断をまとめて準備状況を示します。"

msgid "When a candidate passes, promote them — they become a Trainee and move to the training phase."
msgstr "候補者が合格したら昇格させます — 研修生となり研修段階へ進みます。"

msgid "Training Batches & Modules"
msgstr "研修バッチとモジュール"

msgid "Group trainees into batches and enrol them in training modules (language, skills, culture)."
msgstr "研修生をバッチに分け、研修モジュール（語学・技能・文化）に登録します。"

msgid "Daily & Test Scores"
msgstr "日次評価とテスト結果"

msgid "Record daily scores and periodic competency test results to track each trainee's progress."
msgstr "日々の評価と定期的な技能テストの結果を記録し、研修生ごとの進捗を追跡します。"

msgid "Promote → Apprentice"
msgstr "昇格 → 技能実習生"

msgid "Trainees who pass candidate + training checks are promoted to Apprentice, ready for departure."
msgstr "候補者審査と研修審査に合格した研修生は技能実習生に昇格し、出発準備が整います。"

msgid "Documentation & Departure to Japan"
msgstr "書類手続きと日本への出発"

msgid "Prepare Certificate of Eligibility, visa, passport and pre-departure medical records for each apprentice."
msgstr "実習生ごとに在留資格認定証明書・ビザ・パスポート・出発前の健康記録を準備します。"

